WEBVTT

00:01:56.217 --> 00:01:58.395
It's finally begun!

00:01:58.419 --> 00:02:01.064
The champion, Hanma Baki,
is fighting against

00:02:01.088 --> 00:02:04.935
Shinogi-Style Cord-Cut Karate user,
Shinogi Kosho!

00:02:04.959 --> 00:02:10.307
Just who will be left standing
when the match ends?!

00:02:10.331 --> 00:02:12.843
Hanma... Baki...

00:02:12.867 --> 00:02:18.829
"The Cord-Cut"

00:02:28.115 --> 00:02:31.294
Mom! Mom!

00:02:31.318 --> 00:02:34.598
--Sorry! Bad time?
-It's all right. What is it?

00:02:34.622 --> 00:02:38.735
Have you seen Baki-kun? I lent him
my notebook and I need it back.

00:02:38.759 --> 00:02:41.538
No, I haven't seen him.

00:02:41.562 --> 00:02:43.540
Is he out running again?

00:02:43.564 --> 00:02:47.398
Geez! He could at least
say where he's going!

00:02:56.577 --> 00:03:00.156
He sure disappears a lot.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:03.616
What does he do? Do you know?

00:03:05.819 --> 00:03:09.499
Staying out at night is
how delinquents start out...

00:03:09.523 --> 00:03:13.187
But that bonehead would never turn bad!

00:03:15.529 --> 00:03:20.944
Baki! Baki! Baki! Baki!

00:03:20.968 --> 00:03:23.580
Just listen to this ovation!

00:03:23.604 --> 00:03:25.982
The King, the strongest boy in history,

00:03:26.006 --> 00:03:30.568
may very well be the most popular
king in history as well!

00:03:32.446 --> 00:03:33.857
There are four rules!

00:03:33.881 --> 00:03:37.827
The use of weapons is
absolutely forbidden!

00:03:37.851 --> 00:03:43.199
There is no guarantee
of safety or wellbeing!

00:03:43.223 --> 00:03:48.071
The awardment of goods, money,
or prizes is absolutely forbidden!

00:03:48.095 --> 00:03:53.209
He who ascends to the throne
will have his name forever known!

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:57.714
This is a battle of honor and pride,
with no guarantees or prize money!

00:03:57.738 --> 00:04:00.116
This is pretty damn popular...!

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:03.687
This arena beneath the Tokyo Dome
is a true holy land

00:04:03.711 --> 00:04:07.490
where all manner of
top-class martial artists gather.

00:04:07.514 --> 00:04:12.495
And that boy is a king who
reigns over all of those veterans.

00:04:12.519 --> 00:04:15.511
So that's Hanma Yujiro's son...

00:04:16.357 --> 00:04:21.805
Hanma-kun. Do you know just
how excited I am right now?

00:04:21.829 --> 00:04:26.610
I feel like an innocent boy about to
spend a night with a beautiful girl.

00:04:26.634 --> 00:04:30.480
I'll be frank. I feel like using
my full array of techniques today.

00:04:30.504 --> 00:04:32.515
Shinogi-san.

00:04:32.539 --> 00:04:34.951
| know that you're strong.

00:04:34.975 --> 00:04:40.290
But don't assume you can win here
with a special move or two!

00:04:40.314 --> 00:04:43.579
This is the holy land where
the world's strongest is decided!

00:04:44.785 --> 00:04:47.964
It appears you need
your cords cut as well.

00:04:47.988 --> 00:04:50.867
His cords?

00:04:50.891 --> 00:04:53.837
To think Cord-Cutter Shinogi
would show up here...

00:04:53.861 --> 00:04:55.105
Cord-Cutter?

00:04:55.129 --> 00:04:57.874
I recruited him personally.

00:04:57.898 --> 00:05:01.111
It was during the San Fermin festival
held every year

00:05:01.135 --> 00:05:03.695
in Pamplona, in northern Spain.

00:05:06.874 --> 00:05:08.451
The San Fermin festival?

00:05:08.475 --> 00:05:11.988
Yes. A delightful festival
in which bulls chase people around.

00:05:12.012 --> 00:05:17.382
--That's where you found Shinogi?
--Yes. That was where I first met him.

00:05:29.229 --> 00:05:31.041
Why bulls?

00:05:31.065 --> 00:05:35.412
| asked why he did so, as well.

00:05:35.436 --> 00:05:38.428
| want someone to fight.

00:05:39.773 --> 00:05:41.718
Cord-Cut Karate...

00:05:41.742 --> 00:05:43.186
Despite its great tradition,

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:47.424
its extreme dangerousness
and lack of sparring partners

00:05:47.448 --> 00:05:50.179
has earned it a reputation
as a tragic style.

00:05:51.018 --> 00:05:55.965
How will ol' Baki suppress
that ferocious demon?

00:05:55.989 --> 00:05:58.535
Neither fighter is moving!

00:05:58.559 --> 00:06:02.205
The crowd is holding its breath
as it fixates on their movements!

00:06:02.229 --> 00:06:07.077
They can't move. Both their fists
are extremely lethal weapons.

00:06:07.101 --> 00:06:10.264
It's as if they have knives
in both hands.

00:06:11.605 --> 00:06:14.451
But they both nurture
demons in their hearts.

00:06:14.475 --> 00:06:19.389
Eventually, their fear and wariness
will lose to the desire to fight!

00:06:19.413 --> 00:06:22.178
Which do you believe will move first?

00:06:23.016 --> 00:06:25.295
That's a wonderful question!

00:06:25.319 --> 00:06:28.932
If I had to pick one...

00:06:28.956 --> 00:06:30.788
I knew it!

00:06:46.306 --> 00:06:48.251
Talk about sharp...!

00:06:48.275 --> 00:06:50.286
Terrific...!

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:55.291
In Cord-Cut Karate, palms and feet
aren't meant for striking!

00:06:55.315 --> 00:06:57.861
They're meant for slicing!

00:06:57.885 --> 00:06:59.216
What...?!

00:07:11.365 --> 00:07:13.009
He's strong...!

00:07:13.033 --> 00:07:15.612
But of course! He's the champion!

00:07:15.636 --> 00:07:18.448
Shinogi Kosho is unable to move!

00:07:18.472 --> 00:07:22.773
Is it all over before he can show
the true potential of Cord-Cut Karate?!

00:07:29.783 --> 00:07:31.581
Crap!

00:07:37.758 --> 00:07:41.104
The nerves in his right arm
have been severed!

00:07:41.128 --> 00:07:43.840
The champion has lost
use of his right arm!

00:07:43.864 --> 00:07:46.176
That's the so-called "Cord-Cut".

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:49.479
It may seem underhanded,
but no other karate technique compares

00:07:49.503 --> 00:07:52.015
in terms of bodily destruction.

00:07:52.039 --> 00:07:54.050
Is he gonna be alright...?!

00:07:54.074 --> 00:07:56.653
--Probably hurts.
--Hurts...?

00:07:56.677 --> 00:08:00.990
The pain of having a main nerve
severed is beyond imagination.

00:08:01.014 --> 00:08:03.693
Think back to your dentist visits.

00:08:03.717 --> 00:08:06.812
Moreover, he has no pain-killers!

00:08:08.222 --> 00:08:09.849
Just getting started!

00:08:12.726 --> 00:08:14.103
Lower kick...!

00:08:14.127 --> 00:08:16.372
Middle...!

00:08:16.396 --> 00:08:17.407
Upper!

00:08:17.431 --> 00:08:19.229
I can't move my arm!

00:08:20.701 --> 00:08:23.213
He connects with his toes!

00:08:23.237 --> 00:08:26.969
It's Hell from here on out...

00:08:38.085 --> 00:08:39.696
The champion is a punching bag!

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:42.265
Has the moment of abdication come?!

00:08:42.289 --> 00:08:44.417
T-this is--

00:08:48.028 --> 00:08:51.487
This is... the underground arena?!

00:08:56.069 --> 00:08:59.382
Once I hit you with this ippon-ken...

00:08:59.406 --> 00:09:02.171
...I will be king!

00:09:07.748 --> 00:09:08.758
What the...?!

00:09:08.782 --> 00:09:12.862
The champion retorts
with a devastating counter!

00:09:12.886 --> 00:09:14.097
Shinogi-san.

00:09:14.121 --> 00:09:18.701
Do you think you can take my place
just by debilitating my right arm?!

00:09:18.725 --> 00:09:21.504
Don't you ever forget!

00:09:21.528 --> 00:09:24.589
This is where the
world's strongest is decided!

00:09:25.732 --> 00:09:28.929
--Enough with the tough-guy act.
--I wouldn't be so sure!

00:09:42.549 --> 00:09:43.993
That's our champion!

00:09:44.017 --> 00:09:48.045
He's holding his ground
with only the use of his left arm!

00:09:51.825 --> 00:09:55.171
They're both laughin'...!

00:09:55.195 --> 00:09:57.907
I've waited for a man
like you to appear...

00:09:57.931 --> 00:10:02.345
For the day I could
have a fight like this...

00:10:02.369 --> 00:10:07.250
Please, Master! Train me even more!

00:10:07.274 --> 00:10:09.852
| want to get even stronger!

00:10:09.876 --> 00:10:13.923
Kosho. Why do you wish
to be strong so badly?

00:10:13.947 --> 00:10:19.762
My brother... He's smart,
a good fighter, nice, and cool...

00:10:19.786 --> 00:10:22.432
| respect him more than anyone!

00:10:22.456 --> 00:10:25.482
So I want to get even stronger!

00:10:28.095 --> 00:10:31.207
Kosho. What is the
body's strongest weapon?

00:10:31.231 --> 00:10:32.475
A seiken punch!

00:10:32.499 --> 00:10:38.915
The sharper the body part you use,
the stronger a karate attack becomes.

00:10:38.939 --> 00:10:42.585
More than a seiken, a hiraken!
More than a hiraken, an ippon-ken.

00:10:42.609 --> 00:10:45.237
More than an ippon-ken, a nukite!

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:55.031
From that day on, I began
studying Cord-Cut Karate.

00:10:55.055 --> 00:10:58.267
Brutal man-to-man training...

00:10:58.291 --> 00:11:01.838
But I had no need for tough love.

00:11:01.862 --> 00:11:07.767
Because I had tenacity, passion,
and an object of admiration.

00:11:15.208 --> 00:11:17.575
Is this--

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:23.593
I've taught you all there is.
The burden on my shoulders is lifted.

00:11:23.617 --> 00:11:28.097
From today forth, you are a master
of Shinogi-Style Cord-Cut Karate.

00:11:28.121 --> 00:11:29.966
Master!

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:33.255
I've gained a fine successor...

00:11:38.565 --> 00:11:42.578
But because it's so dangerous,
I could find no domestic opponents,

00:11:42.602 --> 00:11:48.084
so I traveled all the way to Europe,
but found none who satisfied me...

00:11:48.108 --> 00:11:49.385
Hanma Baki!

00:11:49.409 --> 00:11:53.556
I'm delighted from my heart
that I was able to meet you!

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:55.571
Shinogi's serious now.

00:12:15.502 --> 00:12:18.648
Shinogi Kosho's look has changed!

00:12:18.672 --> 00:12:24.053
Does he have something else
besides the terrifying Cord-Cut?!

00:12:24.077 --> 00:12:26.923
The fifteen years
I've practiced karate...

00:12:26.947 --> 00:12:28.958
Is he planning to use it?

00:12:28.982 --> 00:12:32.816
...and the astounding secret
move of the Shinogi Style...

00:12:37.324 --> 00:12:40.225
...| will let you experience them!

00:12:41.561 --> 00:12:44.707
--What an exaggerated stance...
--Kato.

00:12:44.731 --> 00:12:48.578
When it comes to fighting,
only humans use their fists.

00:12:48.602 --> 00:12:51.080
--Do you know why?
--Huh?

00:12:51.104 --> 00:12:55.218
Because unlike animals,
people do not have powerful weapons

00:12:55.242 --> 00:12:58.354
such as claws, fangs, or horns.

00:12:58.378 --> 00:13:03.145
But if we did have claws
as powerful as those of animals...

00:13:10.524 --> 00:13:13.035
That's even sharper
than his nukite was!

00:13:13.059 --> 00:13:17.326
The Shinogi Style's true terror
is not its nukite techniques!

00:13:18.198 --> 00:13:22.078
It is the strength of fingers
trained to their limit!

00:13:22.102 --> 00:13:24.380
Shinogi Kosho unleashes
a relentless attack!

00:13:24.404 --> 00:13:25.982
The champion can't fight back!

00:13:26.006 --> 00:13:28.985
Damn...! He's dodgin' everything!

00:13:29.009 --> 00:13:32.274
Because he'll lose entire bones
if he gets hit.

00:13:39.519 --> 00:13:43.032
He managed to escape,
but he'll get caught eventually.

00:13:43.056 --> 00:13:46.435
It really is like he's
fighting a tiger or a lion...!

00:13:46.459 --> 00:13:51.207
The lust for a fight can
change a man into a beast.

00:13:51.231 --> 00:13:53.042
The same holds true for Baki.

00:13:53.066 --> 00:13:56.712
That's a pretty roundabout
way of putting things.

00:13:56.736 --> 00:14:01.117
That boy known as Hanma Baki
may look gentle at first glance,

00:14:01.141 --> 00:14:05.955
but his obsession with fighting
goes far beyond my own comprehension.

00:14:05.979 --> 00:14:08.624
For the three years
since he appeared before me...

00:14:08.648 --> 00:14:13.496
...he's fought and fought
in this arena, and won...!

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:18.234
And he's transformed this arena
into a real wonderland!

00:14:18.258 --> 00:14:23.539
A 60-kg boy beat 100+ kg martial artists
one after another,

00:14:23.563 --> 00:14:28.277
and lost not even once to
become the undefeated champion!

00:14:28.301 --> 00:14:30.861
That runt did...2?!

00:14:38.912 --> 00:14:41.973
He's actually closing in on me...!

00:14:43.883 --> 00:14:47.945
That's definitely a good attack.
But nothing like his!

00:14:50.390 --> 00:14:51.867
I was right!

00:14:51.891 --> 00:14:55.338
He's quick, but his trajectories simple!

00:14:55.362 --> 00:15:00.109
He saw through it. He may as well
not have a handicap now!

00:15:00.133 --> 00:15:01.828
Damn you...!

00:15:18.752 --> 00:15:21.931
Hanma Baki. Even if this costs me...

00:15:21.955 --> 00:15:24.014
...I will have no regrets!

00:15:25.825 --> 00:15:27.486
He caught him with his shoulder!

00:15:30.063 --> 00:15:31.690
Got you.

00:15:38.872 --> 00:15:44.854
He cut it! He sacrificed his own arm
to unleash a last-ditch Cord-Cut!

00:15:44.878 --> 00:15:47.857
The champion has lost
use of his right eye!

00:15:47.881 --> 00:15:50.426
My right eye...!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:54.717
Hanma Baki. Your victory is now gone...!

00:15:57.624 --> 00:15:58.989
He disappeared!

00:16:08.968 --> 00:16:10.595
Missed me.

00:16:12.605 --> 00:16:14.817
I have no depth perception...!

00:16:14.841 --> 00:16:18.300
He can't use striking attacks. But...

00:16:29.089 --> 00:16:32.101
Burn this face into your memory...

00:16:32.125 --> 00:16:34.804
It's the last face you'll ever see!

00:16:34.828 --> 00:16:37.388
Remember it in the darkness...!

00:16:42.736 --> 00:16:45.915
This is the only time your fists stop.

00:16:45.939 --> 00:16:47.249
He realized it!

00:16:47.273 --> 00:16:47.671
He realized it!

00:16:52.212 --> 00:16:56.559
This is the end!
There's no escape from this position!

00:16:56.583 --> 00:16:58.894
All he can do is give up!

00:16:58.918 --> 00:17:01.263
How humiliating...!

00:17:01.287 --> 00:17:03.299
Shinogi-san! Give up!

00:17:03.323 --> 00:17:05.701
Break it! Go ahead and snap it!

00:17:05.725 --> 00:17:08.037
You'd never do karate again...!

00:17:08.061 --> 00:17:10.773
If it can't even beat you,
what does it matter?!

00:17:10.797 --> 00:17:12.775
You'd never be able to recover from it!

00:17:12.799 --> 00:17:16.345
Snap it! Or I'll bite my tongue off!

00:17:16.369 --> 00:17:17.279
You...

00:17:17.303 --> 00:17:19.670
...idiot!

00:17:30.817 --> 00:17:33.262
The match is over!

00:17:33.286 --> 00:17:35.498
Yes!

00:17:35.522 --> 00:17:43.038
Baki! Baki! Baki!

00:17:43.062 --> 00:17:45.241
Whoa...!

00:17:45.265 --> 00:17:47.877
My blood is boiling...!

00:17:47.901 --> 00:17:55.217
Baki! Baki! Baki!

00:17:55.241 --> 00:17:58.006
"Medical Room"

00:17:59.779 --> 00:18:02.373
Will my nerves reconnect?

00:18:06.085 --> 00:18:07.096
Doctor?!

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:09.265
That was a wonderful match!

00:18:09.289 --> 00:18:12.735
Eh? Uh, yeah...

00:18:12.759 --> 00:18:17.173
It's been so long since I was this moved!
Thanks so much!

00:18:17.197 --> 00:18:20.242
So, what about my nerves?

00:18:20.266 --> 00:18:25.047
Don't worry! It's as easy
as slapping on some glue!

00:18:25.071 --> 00:18:26.682
Also, um...

00:18:26.706 --> 00:18:30.085
| know, I know. Him.

00:18:30.109 --> 00:18:32.578
Here he is!

00:18:33.746 --> 00:18:35.510
Shinogi-san!

00:18:36.749 --> 00:18:38.160
What a disgrace...

00:18:38.184 --> 00:18:40.830
Hardly...!

00:18:40.854 --> 00:18:42.998
Why didn't you break it?

00:18:43.022 --> 00:18:46.335
A few hundred more grams
of your weight from behind

00:18:46.359 --> 00:18:49.672
and it would've completely snapped.

00:18:49.696 --> 00:18:52.775
Breaking your arm wouldn't
have finished you off.

00:18:52.799 --> 00:18:57.646
You probably would've
countered with a kick anyway,

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:01.684
and I didn't have the
strength left to block one...

00:19:01.708 --> 00:19:05.941
In that situation,
knocking you out was my best option.

00:19:12.352 --> 00:19:13.863
Hanma Baki.

00:19:13.887 --> 00:19:15.197
Yes...?

00:19:15.221 --> 00:19:17.417
Keep on winning.

00:19:18.791 --> 00:19:21.123
Right! Thanks!

00:19:22.195 --> 00:19:24.994
Well, I should be going, Doc.

00:19:29.302 --> 00:19:33.582
He's pretty much the only one capable
of fighting with severed nerves!

00:19:33.606 --> 00:19:36.701
He beat you good, Kosho.

00:19:39.746 --> 00:19:42.272
Baki!

00:19:43.049 --> 00:19:45.294
Hey, now...!

00:19:45.318 --> 00:19:47.329
That was a fabulous match!

00:19:47.353 --> 00:19:52.635
You're my champion, all right!
I'm proud of you, Baki!

00:19:52.659 --> 00:19:55.204
| watched your fight, Hanma Baki-kun.

00:19:55.228 --> 00:19:57.172
Orochi... Doppo-san?

00:19:57.196 --> 00:20:00.409
It seems you already know my name.

00:20:00.433 --> 00:20:05.147
That's because there are no
martial artists who don't know your name.

00:20:05.171 --> 00:20:08.317
I haven't been this
excited in a long time.

00:20:08.341 --> 00:20:11.887
Yes. So much that I'd like to fight you.

00:20:11.911 --> 00:20:13.756
Not so fast!

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:15.858
You fight me first!

00:20:15.882 --> 00:20:17.092
Who are you?

00:20:17.116 --> 00:20:20.162
I'm the one who's gonna beat you!

00:20:20.186 --> 00:20:23.884
Act all smug on the champion's throne
while you still can!

00:20:26.926 --> 00:20:29.705
Motobe Izo?!

00:20:29.729 --> 00:20:31.941
You came?

00:20:31.965 --> 00:20:33.542
Motobe lzo?

00:20:33.566 --> 00:20:36.879
You've probably heard
his name before, too.

00:20:36.903 --> 00:20:41.350
He uses no one style, and continues
to perfect ultra-practical jujutsu.

00:20:41.374 --> 00:20:43.552
A living legend.

00:20:43.576 --> 00:20:45.754
How things change.

00:20:45.778 --> 00:20:49.758
What a miserable state old
"Cannibal Orochi" is now in!

00:20:49.782 --> 00:20:53.429
I AM a luminary with
a million pupils now.

00:20:53.453 --> 00:20:56.398
I could kill you in one minute
as you are now.

00:20:56.422 --> 00:20:58.767
This guy's out for blood...!

00:20:58.791 --> 00:21:02.557
--Hanma Baki, was it?
-Y-yes...

00:21:06.933 --> 00:21:08.924
You don't look like him.

00:21:13.873 --> 00:21:16.185
He probably came to see your face.

00:21:16.209 --> 00:21:19.755
Wonderful! All the players
are falling into place!

00:21:19.779 --> 00:21:23.492
Baki! I suggest you visit
Motobe's dojo sometime.

00:21:23.516 --> 00:21:25.594
I'm sure he'll greet you warmly!

00:21:25.618 --> 00:21:28.610
Motobe... Izo...

00:21:36.696 --> 00:21:38.858
Strydom-san!

00:21:39.732 --> 00:21:42.544
It's been five years!
I didn't know you were in Japan!

00:21:42.568 --> 00:21:45.681
| watched your match.

00:21:45.705 --> 00:21:48.083
If you struggled with
an opponent of that caliber,

00:21:48.107 --> 00:21:51.668
you'll never be able to beat the Ogre!

00:21:52.712 --> 00:21:56.425
He's growing stronger even as we speak.

00:21:56.449 --> 00:22:00.079
I'm sure he'll appear
before you someday.

00:22:04.724 --> 00:22:08.683
He's... coming...!

00:22:44.931 --> 00:22:50.479
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.503 --> 00:22:56.085
hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement

00:22:56.109 --> 00:23:01.757
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.781 --> 00:23:06.762
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.786 --> 00:23:12.301
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.325 --> 00:23:17.840
gently enveloped in love

00:23:17.864 --> 00:23:23.512
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.536 --> 00:23:29.051
but they will be reborn

00:23:29.075 --> 00:23:34.723
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.747 --> 00:23:41.346
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:50.229 --> 00:23:52.197
"Next Episode”

00:23:55.401 --> 00:23:59.047
The name of the still-undefeated
boy puts intense pressure

00:23:59.071 --> 00:24:01.083
on those who claim to be strongest.

00:24:01.107 --> 00:24:03.285
Who will challenge him next?

00:24:03.309 --> 00:24:07.389
The men howl in pursuit of the
right to be that next challenger.

00:24:07.413 --> 00:24:13.162
On the boy's undefeated path is
a shadow with a fang-hidden smile.

00:24:13.186 --> 00:24:15.230
He bravely confronts it.

00:24:15.254 --> 00:24:20.215
"Next Episode: Challenger”
